WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.695
Module 13 moves from PostgreSQL database objects
into distributed analytical processing

00:00:05.708 --> 00:00:11.329
with Spark SQL The relational concepts remain
familiar tables

00:00:11.487 --> 00:00:17.007
joins filters grouping and reusable transformations
The

00:00:17.034 --> 00:00:22.594
new challenge is scale and distributed execution
Carry forward the

00:00:22.620 --> 00:00:27.752
interface and grain habits from this module because
they remain important when data processing moves

00:00:27.778 --> 00:00:29.054
to a distributed engine
